{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1494736-france-by-night-in-english","id":1494736,"title":"France by Night in English?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-10T09:13:56-07:00","id":1494736,"title":"France by Night in English?","content":"Hey!<br /> Does anyone know if the book France by Night exists in English? or is it just in French?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11010-ersito","name":"erSito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-10T09:51:49-07:00","id":1494739,"title":"","content":"I'm assuming you are talk about 'Vampire: L'\u00c2ge des T\u00e9n\u00e8bres - DA20 - France By Night.'<br /> <br /> AFAIK there is no plans to translate it to English. There isn't any official word but, on the Paradox WoD Discord someone did ask about it and got this as a response from Outstar:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Outstar</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">All WoD materials go through us, but as we're a licensing brand working with many different companies there are a lot of moving elements and there might be hundreds of reasons why it's not out yet. Unfortunately I can't help anymore, as I don't work with legacy editions much : (</div> </div> </div> </div>So well see but I wouldn't hold your breath unfortunately","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12895-mrnatas","name":"MrNatas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12895_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-10T10:58:44-07:00","id":1494742,"title":"","content":"Yes, I was refering to that one. If anyone knows about a fan made translation or similar, please let me know :-)<br /> <br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11010-ersito","name":"erSito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-11T07:35:21-07:00","id":1494784,"title":"","content":"I bought it in French (thanks to Amazon.fr and livingin the EU, it was easy to get) and read it with my meagre French skills and a liberal use of Google Translate... \ud83d\ude48<br /> <br /> It's really well-made, the art is beautiful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/387-caldorian","name":"Caldorian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-11T09:19:50-07:00","id":1494787,"title":"","content":"Assuming someone would make a fan-translation, would that even be legal (I foresee copyright/intellectual property issues)? If I owned the book, I could most likely make a translation, but sadly I do not have a copy (physical or pdf),","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;La Victoire ou la Mort!&quot;<br /> <br /> Motto of the &quot;Les Fils du Nord&quot; clan","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1100-malkenkaas","name":"MalkenKaas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1100_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-11T09:32:20-07:00","id":1494788,"title":"","content":"DriveThruRPG has the PDF to purchase. I'd imagine its OCR so you could use deepL and Google Translate to get an 'English' version. Otherwise like <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1100-malkenkaas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1100_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1100\" data-vbnamecard=\"1100\">MalkenKaas</a> said, I doubt a &quot;Fan Translation&quot; would be the most 'legal' to distribute.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12895-mrnatas","name":"MrNatas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12895_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T21:31:38-08:00","id":1496887,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately, I couldn't ever find this book in English. What is a real pity, as it's one of the best by night books I've ever read (with my somewhat limited French). It's hard for me to understand why they didn't translate it to English, the book is Gorgeous and full of interesting ideas, a real masterpiece. If anyone come across a translated version, please let me know!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T18:02:29-08:00","id":1497332,"title":"","content":"It's kind of baffling to me that a whole sourcebook for Vampire would just...NOT be released in the game's native language. Granted I'm biased, being an English-As-Only-Language speaker. Imperialism and all that. But it's still really odd. This is the first time I've heard about the book's existence.<br /> <br /> And since it's a DAV20 book, it will probably NEVER be translated officially. Why would the rights holders put the effort into a book that isn't even the edition that want to sell?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-17T05:17:36-08:00","id":1497354,"title":"","content":"There is quite a few books that where never translated into English that I know of. Besides the previous mention book there is all the 'Feder &amp; Schwert' books. &quot;Reichsgold: Aachen bei Nacht&quot; &amp; &quot;Die Stadt, Das Blut, Der Tod: Frankfurt bei Nacht&quot; come to mind. Then there is &quot;Le Monde des T\u00e9n\u00e8bres: France&quot; which is a Crosssplat French book that has stuff that are exclusive to Kiyasd in that book.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Le Monde des T\u00e9n\u00e8bres: France</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">De nombreuses pr\u00e9cisions sur la Cit\u00e9 Secr\u00e8te des Kyasid, le Syndrome d'Interf\u00e9rence Paradigmatique Acquis, les forces du Roi-N\u00e9ant et les puissances obscures qui pr\u00e9sident secretement aux destin\u00e9es des hommes.<br /> <br /> [Many details on the Secret City of the Kyasid, the Acquired Paradigmatic Interference Syndrome, the forces of the Nether King and the dark powers that secretly preside over the destinies of men.]</div> </div> </div> </div>(Thanks google translate)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12895-mrnatas","name":"MrNatas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12895_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"180"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-17T07:36:07-08:00","id":1497361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrNatas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1494736-france-by-night-in-english?p=1497354#post1497354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is quite a few books that where never translated into English that I know of. Besides the previous mention book there is all the 'Feder &amp; Schwert' books. &quot;Reichsgold: Aachen bei Nacht&quot; &amp; &quot;Die Stadt, Das Blut, Der Tod: Frankfurt bei Nacht&quot; come to mind. Then there is &quot;Le Monde des T\u00e9n\u00e8bres: France&quot; which is a Crosssplat French book that has stuff that are exclusive to Kiyasd in that book.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Damn the 'Feder &amp; Schwert' books! Totally forgot about their existence!<br /> <br /> Never got around to reading those and now they're not available anymore one DriveThru. Don't even know if they were any good since I know no other german speaking WOD fan who could've been around at that time! Makes me a little bit sad. Always wanted to run DA Vampire in which is Germany today. Not that there isn't a lot of info on &quot;Germany&quot; in the WOD but a whole City book could've been nice.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25379-spacedigger","name":"Spacedigger","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T16:00:51-08:00","id":1498705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And since it's a DAV20 book, it will probably NEVER be translated officially. Why would the rights holders put the effort into a book that isn't even the edition that want to sell? </div> </div> </div>That also makes me very sad, makes me even want to arrange a translation myself, the book is so wonderful, would easily be in my top 5 books released on WoD's history. Very beautiful and full of interesting ideas (not to mention that it's the only book in WoD that actually gives Goratrix traits and a full character sheet, what is a shame that before that nobody ever cared to give traits to such an important character in the WoD's history). This book is a treasure, I intend to one day make something about this translation, because it's a pity most of my friends cannot enjoy it since it's in another language.<br /> <br /> I'm also interested in the Feder und Schwert books, but unfortunately could never find them. I've heard they're also very beautiful (though it's hard to believe they surpass Dark Ages France, as it's one of the most beautiful books I've ever seen). I wish we could do something about it, really.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}